OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F106A1789413860
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI 'kill switch' may need to be
OL,4,Amandatory, Anthropic co-founder says
OL,5,
OL,6,FClark said "most labs have different
OL,7,Fways of being able to pull the plug",
OL,8,Fincluding Anthropic, but said
OL,9,Fpolicymakers may need to enforce having
OL,10,Fone.
OL,12,FClark's comments come as a growing
OL,13,Fnumbers of executives and staff of AI
OL,14,Ffirms, as well as AI experts, have
OL,15,Fpublicly said AI could kill all humans.
